[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0034","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0906","title":"Sendmail DNS查询TXT记录响应处理缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.12.5 之前版本中，当配置使用自定义 DNS 映射查询 TXT 记录时，其处理 DNS 应答的代码存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过控制恶意 DNS 服务器向目标 Sendmail 服务器发送特制的 DNS 应答数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝响应，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响广泛部署的邮件传输代理软件，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0906"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:21Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.12.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 parse_dns_reply 函数中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可临时移除或禁用自定义 DNS map（custom DNS map）中对 TXT 记录的查询配置，避免向不可信 DNS 服务器发起 TXT 记录请求以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9443.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/814627","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5122","http://www.sendmail.org/8.12.5.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2183","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0906.json","https://github.com/REMath/implementations/blob/045b59dc77d5bd3e9a14713898ebcfdebacd11e9/tanalysis/tanalysis/verisec%20v1.0/sendmail/CVE-2002-0906/README","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0906","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0906.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0906.json","https://github.com/dceara/tanalysis/blob/5496d33e632fdb8852ce65082fdb31aec0fab8d4/tanalysis/verisec%20v1.0/sendmail/CVE-2002-0906/README.STAC","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-www2-vw26-5r85/GHSA-www2-vw26-5r85.json","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt","https://github.com/westtide/open-source-case-studies/blob/57e71842cdb3e034316b0d083f8d19f680501b67/verisec/.frama-c/programs_apps_sendmail_CVE-2002-0906_parse_dns_reply_parse_dns_reply_cast_ok.eva/metrics.log","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0033","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0901","title":"AMANDA 多缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"AMANDA（Advanced Maryland Automatic Network Disk Archiver）2.3.0.4 版本中存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 amindexd 守护进程发送超长命令触发溢出，导致任意代码执行；本地用户亦可利用 amcheck、amgetidx、amtrmidx、createindex-dump、createindex-gnutar 等工具的超长命令行参数触发溢出，实现权限提升或任意代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，受影响系统需尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0901"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:21Z","remediation":"立即升级 AMANDA 至 3.5.3 或更高版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对 amindexd 服务（默认端口 10080）的访问，仅允许可信备份客户端连接，并限制本地非授权用户对 amcheck、amgetidx 等 SUID 程序的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/274215","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9181.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9182.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4836","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4840","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0901.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0901","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0901.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0901.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4ff8-c98x-v6m4/GHSA-4ff8-c98x-v6m4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x5000/4836/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149100_149200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0901.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6fde668a-4a7c-4c87-a416-383882d2768d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0032","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0896","title":"Swatch 日志监控工具抑制事件报告漏洞","description":"Swatch（Simple Watcher）日志监控工具的抑制（throttle）机制存在逻辑缺陷，当同一类型事件在抑制周期结束后再次出现，或匹配同一 \"watchfor\" 表达式的多个事件未在抑制周期内连续发生时，抑制模块可能无法正常上报这些事件。远程攻击者可利用此缺陷，通过精心安排攻击事件的时间间隔来绕过日志告警系统的检测，从而隐藏恶意行为不被发现。该漏洞影响 Swatch 日志监控系统的告警完整性，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0896"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:20Z","remediation":"升级到 Swatch 3.0 以上版本或迁移至其继任者 swatchdog（最新版 3.2.3），该版本已修复 throttle 抑制事件报告的缺陷。如无法升级，可在 Swatch 配置中增大 throttle_period 参数值并避免在同一个 watchfor 表达式中匹配多条规则，同时启用多个独立 throttle 实例分别监控不同事件类型以降低漏报风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/272582","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9100.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4746","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0896.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0896","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0896.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0896.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2q4j-p6fg-wmfg/GHSA-2q4j-p6fg-wmfg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0896.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149100_149200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dc98e45b-d429-49b6-9b99-c3a86722063e.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x5000/4746/info.html","https://github.com/masterfabric/masterfabric-pre-release/blob/d9d6f5c519248b656db787087e36b71c4b7a8ee9/cases/reports/nextjs_security_report.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0001","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1131","title":"SquirrelMail 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"` tags\n\nFrom the NVD data and pre-search results, I can construct a proper Chinese description:\n\n- CVE-2002-1131: Cross-site scripting vulnerabilities in SquirrelMail 1.2.7 and earlier\n- Affected files: addressbook.php, options.php, search.php, help.php\n- Remote attackers can execute script as other web users\n- CVSS 7.5 (HIGH)\n- No authentication required, network-based attack\n\nLet me write a proper description that's ≥50 Chinese characters, covering principle, impact, and attackconditions.<value>SquirrelMail 1.2.7及更早版本的addressbook.php、options.php、search.php、help.php等多个页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份验证即可向这些页面的查询参数注入恶意HTML和JavaScript代码，当其他用户访问特制URL时恶意脚本在浏览器中执行，可导致会话劫持、敏感信息窃取、钓鱼攻击等危害。攻击者通过构造包含恶意载荷的链接诱使用户点击即可触发，攻击条件低、影响范围广。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1131"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:47Z","remediation":"升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.8 或更高版本，该版本已修复 addressbook.php、options.php、search.php、help.php 中的跨站脚本漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 WAF 规则，对上述四个脚本的查询参数进行输入过滤，过滤 `<script>`、`onerror=` 等 XSS 关键字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0246.html","http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?group_id=311&release_id=110774","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-191","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10145.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-204.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5763","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21811","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2002/CVE-2002-1131.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1131.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2002/CVE-2002-1131.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2002-1131.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2002-1131-1304.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2002-1131-1301.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2002-1131-1302.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2002-1131-1303.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/SquirrelMail/CVE-2002-1131.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2002-1131.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2002/CVE-2002-1131.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0516","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0516.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1028","title":"Oddsock Song Requester 2.1 WinAmp 插件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oddsock Song Requester 2.1 WinAmp 插件存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向运行该插件的 WinAmp 客户端发送特制的请求，触发插件处理异常导致程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 WinAmp 配合 Oddsock Song Requester 2.1 版本的环境，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级中危。目前已有公开的 PoC 代码，建议用户禁用该插件或升级到更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1028"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2002-10-04T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Oddsock Song Requester WinAmp 插件升级至 2.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 CGI 程序中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可卸载该插件或删除其 CGI 相关文件（如 gen_songrequester.dll），并确保 WinAmp 不监听外部网络请求以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21620","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1028.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1028","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1028.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1028.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8eb5179bc94e368fed99f8f208b080aa4b8a56b8/2002/CVE-2002-1028.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1028.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1028.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1028.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1028.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0516.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0410","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0410.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1642","title":"PostgreSQL VACUUM 命令本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL 7.2.1 及 7.2.2 版本中存在安全漏洞，本地攻击者可通过执行 VACUUM 命令删除事务日志（pg_clog）数据，导致数据库数据丢失及拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 VACUUM 操作对事务日志文件的权限检查不足，攻击者需拥有本地操作系统访问权限即可触发，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至 PostgreSQL 7.2.3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1642"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:42Z","remediation":"升级 PostgreSQL 至 7.2.3 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 7.2.3 中修复。如无法升级，限制不可信用户对数据库服务器的本地登录权限，仅允许受信任的管理员执行 VACUUM 操作，并定期备份 pg_clog 目录数据以防数据丢失。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.postgresql.org/pgsql-announce/2002-10/msg00000.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/891177","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7657","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11102","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1642.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1642.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1642","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1642.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1642.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2002/CVE-2002-1642.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1642.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-16xx/CVE-2002-1642.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1642.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1642.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0410.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0106","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1593","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_dav 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0.41 及更早版本中的 mod_dav 模块未能正确处理版本控制钩子（versioning hooks），存在空指针解引用漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的 WebDAV 请求触发空指针解引用，导致 Apache 子进程崩溃，在 preforked 多进程模式下引发 CPU 资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.0.41 及之前版本，升级至 2.0.42 及以上版本可修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1593"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-09-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:37Z","remediation":"立即将 Apache HTTP Server 升级至 2.0.42 或更新版本，此版本修复了 mod_dav 处理 versioning hooks 时存在的空指针解引用缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在 httpd.conf 中注释或移除 LoadModule dav_module modules/mod_dav.so 行以禁用 WebDAV 功能，缓解拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://securitytracker.com/id?1005285","http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/CHANGES_2.0","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/406121","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5816","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10208","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5df9bfb86a3b054bb985a45ff9250b0332c9ecc181eec232489e7f79%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0276683d8e1e07153fc8642618830ac0ade85b9ae0dc7b07f63bb8fc%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r2cb985de917e7da0848c440535f65a247754db8b2154a10089e4247b%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5001ecf3d6b2bdd0b732e527654248abb264f08390045d30709a92f6%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r7035b7c9091c4b665a3b7205364775410646f12125d48e74e395f2ce%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r8828e649175df56f1f9e3919938ac7826128525426e2748f0ab62feb%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9e8622254184645bc963a1d47c5d47f6d5a36d6f080d8d2c43b2b142%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rd00b45b93fda4a5bd013b28587207d0e00f99f6e3308dbb6025f3b01%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/re028d61fe612b0908595d658b9b39e74bca56f2a1ed3c5f06b5ab571%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1