wmmon、wmnet2）至厂商修复版本。如无法升级，限制 /dev/mem 和 /dev/kmem 文件权限为仅 root 可读（chmod 600 /dev/mem /dev/kmem），并确保受影响程序以非特权用户运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0115.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103228135413310&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10109.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5714","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5716","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5718","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5719","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5720","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21796","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1125.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1125","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1125.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1125.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2002/CVE-2002-1125.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1125.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1125.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1125.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1125.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1125.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0541.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0541.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0540","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0540.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1123","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 用户认证远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 及 Microsoft Desktop Engine (MSDE) 2000 的用户认证函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 TCP 1433 端口发送特制的超长请求（即 \"Hello\" 溢出），触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以 SQL Server 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SQL Server 2000 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS02-056 中发布补丁修复此漏洞，Metasploit 框架已集成公开利用模块。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1123"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:46Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-056 提供的补丁，或升级至 SQL Server 2000 Service Pack 4。如无法升级，在防火墙上封锁 TCP 端口 1433 以阻止远程攻击。对于 MSDE 2000 实例，建议禁用不必要的网络连接或升级至受支持的 SQL Server 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102873609025020&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/286220","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-003.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9788.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5411","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-056","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21693","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1123.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1123.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1123","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1123.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1123.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1123.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1123.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2002/CVE-2002-1123.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1123.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/7b0091a6728c321d97febad01bf502be7a113020/config/msf_cve-db.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0540.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0539","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0539.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1120","title":"Savant Web Server 3.1 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Savant Web Server 3.1 及更早版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求即可触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响范围广。Metasploit 框架已集成该漏洞的利用模块，攻击者可轻易获取服务器控制权。建议升级至最新版本或应用厂商补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1120"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:45Z","remediation":"Savant Web Server 已停止维护，官方不再发布安全更新。建议立即停止使用 Savant Web Server，迁移至 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx 等仍在积极维护的 Web 服务器。如无法立即迁移，可在 Web 服务器前端部署 IPS/IDS 设备，配置规则拦截超长 HTTP GET 请求（长度超过 4096 字节）以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0112.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10076.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5686","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16770/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16770","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2002/CVE-2002-1120.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/400ed050b78dffbc3594fd5bafe67494479fdfd3/2002/CVE-2002-1120.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1120.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/35f9b3e8357e0d8772fff063705476aef1eab27f/2002/CVE-2002-1120.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1120.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1120.json","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/d24a5a8be0b7d73aac52414040bb7258c96a81c0/2002/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1120","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/d85e3a1792768837470e0c79fd15b0f8bd851146/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-1120.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1120.json","https://github.com/TheMalwareGuardian/CVE-2002-1120"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0539.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0500","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0987","title":"Caldera OpenUNIX/UnixWare X Server 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"OpenUNIX 8.0.0 和 UnixWare 7.1.1 中的 Xsco X Server 在调用 xkbcomp 等外部程序时未正确丢弃特权权限，通过 popen 函数以高权限执行外部命令，导致本地用户可利用该漏洞提升至 root 权限。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，通过触发 X Server 调用外部程序即可实现权限提升，完全影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0987"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:31Z","remediation":"立即安装 SCO 官方安全公告 CSSA-2002-SCO.38 提供的补丁，该补丁可从 SCO FTP 服务器获取。具体操作为：以 root 身份登录系统，下载补丁包后执行 `pkgadd -d <补丁文件>` 安装。如无法立即打补丁，临时缓解措施为移除 Xsco 的 setuid 位（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/X11/Xsco`），或限制本地用户对 X 服务器的直接访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9976.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5044","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5575","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21758","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df205751150